    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 3328478bacda49ec85c71b930a2e9679
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'An overseer that never fights (spotter drone, scout, watcher — any faction): keeps its target in view from 14–20 m, out of its sight where it can, launches its signature (Kit › Signature, e.g. a Survey Beacon) toward it and radios its kin every 10 s so they converge; backs off from anything within 10 m. Best on a Network (union) enemy, whose sightings reach everyone. Kill it first.'
        _children:
        - 1f1f0bf4fb6346218b879cb196370abb
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
